  "prefLabel": "Tra 304.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-01-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 304.02 Scope. Tra 304 shall apply to any individual or business organization wishing to move a non-divisible vehicle, object, or vehicle and load within the state of New Hampshire on the state highway system that has a weight, width, height, or length greater than the limits set forth in RSA 266.\n\nSource. #4129, eff 9-10-86, EXPIRED: 9-10-92\n\nNew. #5621, eff 5-4-93; ss by #6992, INTERIM, eff 5-5-99, EXPIRED: 9-2-99\n\nNew. #7193, eff 1-26-00, EXPIRED: 1-26-08\n\nNew. #10816, eff 4-23-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra300.html"
